# Installer-test fixtures are byte-exact test data: the fake release
# payloads' digests are asserted against the SHA256SUMS-* fixtures, so a
# CRLF-rewriting checkout (Windows runners default core.autocrlf=true)
# changes the digests and fails the installer checksum assertions. Never
# line-ending-normalize anything under the fixture tree.
scripts/tests/fixtures/** -text